OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks to cause 'severe
OL,4,Acongestion' at M60 junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned of
OL,7,Fwidespread disruption as #300m of
OL,8,Fimprovement work is set to begin across
OL,9,Fa stretch of Greater Manchester
OL,10,Fmotorway.
OL,12,FRoad closures, diversions and temporary
OL,13,Fspeed limits will be in place at
OL,14,FSimister Island in Bury from Saturday,
OL,15,Fas work begins on a #255m-#296m project
OL,16,Fat Junction 18 of the M60.
OL,18,FThe ring road will be closed in both
OL,19,Fdirections between Junctions 17 and 18
OL,20,Fover the course of two weekends - 26
OL,21,FSeptember to 28 September and 10
OL,22,FOctober to 12 October.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
