OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks to cause 'severe
OL,4,Acongestion' at M60 junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways has advised road
OL,7,Fusers to expect "severe congestion" and
OL,8,Fto "avoid travelling" in the area
OL,9,Fduring the weekend - adding "it's going
OL,10,Fto be busy".
